{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20580","headline":"酬浙东元尚书见寄绫素 · 张籍","name":"酬浙东元尚书见寄绫素","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"越地缯纱纹样新，远封来寄学曹人。\n便令裁制爲时服，顿觉光荣上病身。\n应念此官同弃置，独能相贺更殷勤。\n三千里外无由见，海上东风又一春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20580.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20580","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}